{"seq":2,"slug":"outlier-handling","title":"异常值与混合精度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-quantization-gptq-awq/methods/outlier-handling","wordCount":1600,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"异常值与混合精度\">异常值与混合精度</h1><p>试着把一个 OPT-175B 的激活直接量化到 INT8，再跑一遍——输出几乎是随机噪声。问题不在算法实现，而在 LLM 激活里潜伏的一小撮「异常值」：在某些固定的特征维度上，激活值会突然大到比邻居大上百倍。把它们和正常值塞进同一个 8 比特区间，这几个巨值会撑爆量化范围，逼得其余所有值被压进区间一角、分辨率所剩无几。这一篇讲清这个现象，以及业界对付它的两条思路——堵和疏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-激活异常值现象\">核心概念：激活异常值现象</h2><p>异常值是激活量化（而非权重量化）特有的拦路虎。研究反复观察到：在十亿参数以上的 Transformer 里，激活的少数固定特征维度上会出现系统性的大值，幅度可达其余维度的数十到上百倍，且它们集中在少量通道上、跨不同 token 高度一致。</p>\n<p>为什么这要命？量化范围由最大值决定。INT8 把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[-\\max, +\\max]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 映射到 256 个格点，若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span></span> 被一个异常值撑到 100，而 99% 的正常值都在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[-1, 1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 内，那么正常值实际只用到 256 个格点里的两三个——有效精度从 8 比特坍缩到约 2 比特。权重量化没这个问题，因为权重分布温和、无极端异常值。下表对比两者：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对象</th>\n<th>分布特征</th>\n<th>异常值</th>\n<th>量化难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>权重</td>\n<td>近似正态，温和</td>\n<td>几乎没有</td>\n<td>容易，4 比特可控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>激活</td>\n<td>长尾，少数维度巨大</td>\n<td>系统性、固定通道</td>\n<td>难，朴素 INT8 即崩溃</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这就解释了 <a href=\"../foundations/quantization-spectrum\">量化谱系</a> 里的一个现象：W4A16（仅权重）简单稳，而 W8A8（连激活一起量）棘手——棘手的全部来源就是激活异常值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"思路一-堵-混合精度隔离异常值\">思路一：堵——混合精度隔离异常值</h2><p>第一条对策直截了当：既然只有少数维度异常，就把它们单独拎出来用高精度算，其余正常维度照常低精度量化。这就是<strong>混合精度（mixed-precision）</strong> 分解，代表作是 <strong>LLM.int8()</strong>。</p>\n<p>它的做法是：对每个矩阵乘，先识别出含异常值的那些特征维度（按一个幅度阈值，通常占比远小于 1%），把这部分激活和对应权重列保留 FP16 走一条「高精度旁路」，剩下绝大多数维度走 INT8 主路，最后把两路结果相加。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mtext>正常</mtext></msub><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>正常</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>INT8 主路</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mtext>异常</mtext></msub><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>异常</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>FP16 旁路</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">XW = \\underbrace{X_{\\text{正常}} W_{\\text{正常}}}_{\\text{INT8 主路}} + \\underbrace{X_{\\text{异常}} W_{\\text{异常}}}_{\\text{FP16 旁路}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1597em;vertical-align:-1.4763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.5237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">INT8 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">主路</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.202em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">正常</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">正常</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.798em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1597em;vertical-align:-1.4763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.5237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">FP16 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">旁路</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.202em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">异常</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">异常</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.798em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>因为异常维度占比极小，FP16 旁路只占总计算的零头，整体仍接近 INT8 的速度，却避免了异常值毒化主路的量化范围。混合精度的代价是实现复杂：要动态检测异常列、维护两条数据路径、做稀疏矩阵乘，内核工程不轻松。这条「保留少数关键值高精度」的思想，也延续到了下一章 <a href=\"../techniques/awq-smoothquant\">AWQ</a> 对权重重要通道的保护。</p>\n<h2 id=\"思路二-疏-把异常值难度迁移给权重\">思路二：疏——把异常值难度迁移给权重</h2><p>第二条对策更巧妙：不隔离异常值，而是从数学上「抹平」它们。关键观察是——激活很「异常」，但权重很「温和」，那能不能把激活的量化难度匀一部分给权重，让两边都变得好量化？</p>\n<p>这正是 <strong>SmoothQuant</strong> 的核心。对一个矩阵乘 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y = XW</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>，引入一个逐通道的缩放向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，做一个数学上恒等的变换：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>diag</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>diag</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>W</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y = XW = (X \\cdot \\text{diag}(s)^{-1})(\\text{diag}(s) \\cdot W) = \\hat{X}\\hat{W}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">diag</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">diag</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>把激活 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 的每个通道除以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>（缩小异常值）、权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 的对应通道乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>（放大一点），乘积完全不变，但 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{X}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的异常值被压下去、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>W</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{W}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 仍在可控范围。难度从激活「迁移」到了权重，两边都变得适合量化。缩放因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 通常按激活和权重各自幅度的几何平衡来取，平滑强度由一个超参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 控制。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[激活有系统性异常值&lt;br/&gt;少数维度幅度x100] --&gt; B{对策}&#10;  B --&gt;|堵: 隔离| C[混合精度 LLM.int8]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[异常维度走 FP16 旁路]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[正常维度走 INT8 主路]&#10;  C1 --&gt; C3[两路相加]&#10;  C2 --&gt; C3&#10;  B --&gt;|疏: 迁移| D[SmoothQuant 平滑]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[激活除以 s 缩小异常]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[权重乘以 s 数学等价]&#10;  D1 --&gt; D3[两边都好量化 W8A8 可用]&#10;  D2 --&gt; D3\">flowchart TD\n  A[激活有系统性异常值&lt;br/&gt;少数维度幅度x100] --&gt; B{对策}\n  B --&gt;|堵: 隔离| C[混合精度 LLM.int8]\n  C --&gt; C1[异常维度走 FP16 旁路]\n  C --&gt; C2[正常维度走 INT8 主路]\n  C1 --&gt; C3[两路相加]\n  C2 --&gt; C3\n  B --&gt;|疏: 迁移| D[SmoothQuant 平滑]\n  D --&gt; D1[激活除以 s 缩小异常]\n  D --&gt; D2[权重乘以 s 数学等价]\n  D1 --&gt; D3[两边都好量化 W8A8 可用]\n  D2 --&gt; D3</pre><p>据 SmoothQuant 的报告，它让 W8A8 激活量化在 OPT、BLOOM、LLaMA 等模型上几乎无损，相比朴素 W8A8「输出近乎随机」是质的飞跃，并带来最高约 1.56 倍加速、2 倍显存节省。SmoothQuant 的完整算法细节在 <a href=\"../techniques/awq-smoothquant\">AWQ 与 SmoothQuant</a> 展开，本篇只讲它「疏导难度」的核心思想。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两条思路的取舍\">两条思路的取舍</h2><p>堵和疏不是非此即彼，它们适配不同场景。混合精度（堵）不改变任何数值、保留原始精度，对精度最敏感的场景稳，但内核复杂、有动态稀疏开销。平滑（疏）一次离线变换搞定、推理时是规整的稠密矩阵乘、对硬件友好，但缩放强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 是需要调的超参，过度平滑会反过来伤权重。</p>\n<p>下表小结：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>堵（混合精度）</td>\n<td>LLM.int8()</td>\n<td>不损精度、无需调参</td>\n<td>内核复杂、动态稀疏开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>疏（平滑迁移）</td>\n<td>SmoothQuant</td>\n<td>推理稠密规整、硬件友好</td>\n<td>需调平滑超参 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>值得一提的是，2026 年有研究指出，随着模型架构演进（如更普遍的归一化、训练技巧改进），异常值现象和校准集的影响在部分现代 LLM 上有所减弱——但在跨模型的通用量化里，异常值处理仍是激活量化绕不开的一环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>激活异常值是激活量化特有的难题：少数固定维度的值大上百倍，撑爆量化范围、把正常值精度压到约 2 比特；权重无此问题。</li>\n<li>「堵」的思路用混合精度（LLM.int8()）把异常维度隔离到 FP16 旁路、其余走 INT8，不损精度但内核复杂。</li>\n<li>「疏」的思路用 SmoothQuant 做数学等价的逐通道缩放，把异常难度从激活迁移给权重，让 W8A8 从崩溃变可用。</li>\n<li>两条思路适配不同场景：堵稳但复杂，疏规整但需调参；异常值处理是 W8A8/W4A8 激活量化的核心前提。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>上游 <a href=\"../foundations/quantization-spectrum\">量化谱系</a>：本篇解释了为何「量化对象」轴上量激活比量权重难得多。</li>\n<li>下游 <a href=\"../techniques/awq-smoothquant\">AWQ 与 SmoothQuant</a>：SmoothQuant 的完整算法与 AWQ 的权重保护实现。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../llm-serving-inference-systems/systems/quantization-tensorrt\">推理系统 · TensorRT 量化</a> 看 W8A8 在生产引擎中的落地。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"异常值与混合精度","id":"异常值与混合精度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：激活异常值现象","id":"核心概念-激活异常值现象"},{"level":2,"text":"思路一：堵——混合精度隔离异常值","id":"思路一-堵-混合精度隔离异常值"},{"level":2,"text":"思路二：疏——把异常值难度迁移给权重","id":"思路二-疏-把异常值难度迁移给权重"},{"level":2,"text":"两条思路的取舍","id":"两条思路的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"PTQ 与 QAT","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-quantization-gptq-awq/methods/ptq-vs-qat"},"next":{"title":"校准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-quantization-gptq-awq/methods/calibration"}}